1
00:05:16,666 --> 00:05:22,666
It was the perfect honeymoon...until it began.

2
00:10:33,333 --> 00:10:39,333
Just Married is a romance, comedy film directed by Shawn Levy.

3
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:56,000
Although Tom Leezak and Sarah McNerney come from different worlds, they are
both unexpectedly swept off their feet after their first meeting.

4
00:21:06,666 --> 00:21:12,666
They quickly fall in love and plan to get married, despite
opposition from Sarah's uptight, rich family.

5
00:26:23,333 --> 00:26:29,333
After their wedding, the happy couple sets off - with the highest of hopes and ideals about
love and marriage - on what they expect will be the perfect honeymoon in Italy.

6
00:31:40,000 --> 00:31:46,000
Thanks to a relentless string of bad luck with one disaster after another, and an impromptu visit from Sarah's wealthy one-time
ex-lover Peter Prentiss, the newlyweds experience the honeymoon from hell that tests the limits of their young love.

7
00:36:56,666 --> 00:37:02,666
Is it worth throwing away their love and marriage?

8
00:42:13,333 --> 00:42:19,333
Tom Leezak, played by Ashton Kutcher.

9
00:47:30,000 --> 00:47:36,000
Sarah McNerney, played by Brittany Murphy.

10
00:52:46,666 --> 00:52:52,666
Peter Prentiss, played by Christian Kane.

11
00:58:03,333 --> 00:58:09,333
Kyle, played by David Moscow.

12
01:03:20,000 --> 01:03:26,000
Lauren McNerney, played by Monet Mazur.

13
01:08:36,666 --> 01:08:42,666
Mr. McNerney, played by David Rasche.

14
01:13:53,333 --> 01:13:59,333
Just Married is a 2003 romantic comedy film directed by Shawn Levy, written by Sam Harper, and stars Ashton Kutcher and Brittany Murphy as a young newlywed
couple from different social classes who take their honeymoon to Europe, where obstacles challenge their ability to sustain in marriage.

15
01:19:10,000 --> 01:19:16,000
Released by 20th Century Fox on January 10, 2003, the film was
successful at the box office despite being critically panned.

16
01:24:26,666 --> 01:24:32,666
The film explores themes of jealousy, france,
venice, italy, married couple, ex-lover.

17
01:29:43,333 --> 01:29:49,333
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
